 adjoining a park or directly opposite a park fronting the same street - refer to standard as in QDC but measured to wall || Min 4.5m ; Greater than 8.5m || Min 6m || Min 5m || N/A || Min 3m || Min 2m || N/A || Min 0.5 || Refer to standard as in QDC but measured to wall || Min 5m OR Where the longest side boundary is ≤25m or where the primary frontage is ≤9.5m - Min 3m OR Where the primary frontage is ≤9.5m and the lot is adjoining a park or directly opposite a park fronting the same street - refer to standard as in QDC but measured to wall || Min 4.5m$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', $q$rules 32379, 30076, 30027-30030$q$, NULL, $q$9.3.1 Dwelling house code$q$, NULL, $q$https://eplan.moretonbay.qld.gov.au/planningscheme/api/l/r/226/0/false/11-Sep-2026/false$q$, $q$Setback = 'shortest distance measured horizontally from the outer most projection of a building or structure to the vertical projection of the boundary of the lot'. The tables split columns 'To wall' vs 'To OMP' (outermost projection) and 'To covered car parking space and domestic outbuildings'. Row selection is by 'Height of wall' (not defined in the scheme).$q$, $q$mb_dh_t93115_nextgen_rear$q$);
