he length of the boundary Max Height: 10.5m ; Greater than 18m || Not permitted* || Not permitted* || Not Permitted* || Not Permitted*. Note - The above setbacks apply only to Class 1a and Class 10a buildings/structures. Note - Max length includes the length of walls of any other buildings on the same boundary. e.g detached garage, carport or shed. Note - For the maximum height of domestic outbuildings refer to the examples that achieve aspects of the performance outcomes for building height and domestic outbuildings. *Note - Built to boundary walls are not permitted, however, reduced side and rear boundary clearances may be permitted as prescribed (e.g QDC).", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m|%", "on_noncompliance": "REFERRAL_TO_LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "effective_from": "2026-09-11", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "MORETON_BAY"}, {"level": "PRECINCT", "precinct": "CMB:GENERAL_RESIDENTIAL/URBAN_NEIGHBOURHOOD"}, {"level": "PRECINCT", "precinct": "CMB:EMERGING_COMMUNITY/TRANSITION_DEVELOPED_LOT_MORAYFIELD_SOUTH"}], "subjects": ["CLASS_10A", "CLASS_1"], "sources": [{"key": "mb_dh_t93117_btb_urban", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"btb_max_length_height\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m|%\", \"conditions\": [\"frontage <= 7.5 m: max 80% length, height 8.5 m\", \"> 7.5-12.5 m: max 70% length, height 10.5 m\", \"> 12.5-18 m: lesser of 15 m or 60%, height 10.5 m\", \"> 18 m: not permitted\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'Class 1a and Class 10a' mapped by keyword to ['CLASS_10A', 'CLASS_1']\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: YES - RAD carries note 'Non-compliance with this RAD is a planning scheme matter for which Council will exercise a concurrence agency role ...'; Table 1.6.1 identifies 9.3.1 'RADs and performance outcomes id